Package: x-messenger
Version: 1.5.3
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64 arm64 armhf
Depends: nodejs, python3, python3-gi, libc6, libgtk-3-0, gir1.2-webkit-4.0
Maintainer: jackh0006 <jackh109867@gmail.com>
Description: Offline-first encrypted QR courier - no accounts, no servers
 X Messenger is a free, open-source, offline-first encrypted courier.
 Seal a message on this device, hand it over as a QR code, copied text,
 or .xmsg file. No internet required. No accounts. No servers to leak.
 Homepage: https://github.com/jackh0006/X-Messenger
